WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.950
Every day, your team has questions.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.900
Instead of searching folders…
or interrupting a manager…

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.260
they simply ask.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.900
Your company's AI searches the knowledge
your team has already shared.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.330
Videos. Guides. Processes. Experience.

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.760
The right answer.
Exactly when it's needed.

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.680
And when something isn't working…
your team tells the AI.

8
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.400
Every question. Every frustration.
Every obstacle…

9
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.540
reveals where your business can improve.

10
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.590
So leaders see patterns…
before small problems become expensive ones.

11
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.780
Academy Platforms.

12
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.400
Ask your business.
Learn together. Improve every day.
